  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intertraffic Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to provide an opportunity for Colombian public and private entities that are involved in the mobility sector to participate in the Intertraffic Event that will take place in Amsterdam in 2020. In addition, these entities will also get a chance to participate in a parallel program, which allows them to meet and network with Dutch mobility companies.</narrative>
  </description>
